@inherits LayoutComponentBase

@*
    No shell at all, on purpose.

    The Blazor template puts every page inside a sidebar, a navigation menu and a
    top row. The Angular app has none of those: each page is its own Bootstrap
    container and the workspace carries its own header. Reproducing it therefore
    means deleting the chrome rather than restyling it.

    The diagnostic page at /smoke is reachable by URL; it was never part of the
    Angular app and does not belong in a menu that the Angular app does not have.
*@

@Body
